  "help": "<div class=\"section\" id=\"convert-scrna-data-object-between-formats-sceasy-convertformat\">\n<h1>Convert scRNA data object between formats <cite>sceasy::convertFormat()</cite></h1>\n<dl class=\"docutils\">\n<dt>Support the following conversion:</dt>\n<dd><ul class=\"first last simple\">\n<li>Loom &lt;-&gt; SingleCellExperiment (full)</li>\n<li>SingleCellExperiment -&gt; AnnData (matrix, metadata, reducedDim)</li>\n<li>Seurat -&gt; AnnData (matrix, metadata, reducedDim)</li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>More information can be found at <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/cellgeni/sceasy\">https://github.com/cellgeni/sceasy</a></p>\n<p><strong>Version history</strong></p>\n<p>0.0.1+galaxy0: Initial version based on sceasy 0.0.5 by Ni Huang, WTSI.</p>\n</div>\n",
